WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.800
One company. Sixteen model calls.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.700
The second reader paid all sixteen again.

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.900
The page's own text is the key.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.900
So a stale hit is impossible, not bounded.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.000
A failure is never remembered.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.500
The next reader asks again instead.

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.800
Bounded in bytes and in entries.

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.800
And the rule sits where a test can call it.

9
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.000
The second reader does not pay the model.
